{
    "name": "dsh-weather-sandbox",
    "displayName": "deepnoseedown · AI 原生创世沙盒",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "AI 原生创世沙盒。点一下「创世」，一个新 AI 就降临到这个世界里 —— 它出生就带着两本手册（怎么动手、怎么想），然后用十四个工具直接盖东西。你也能：拖一张照片进世界，它变成真方块，背景和人物自动分开、人物浮在前面有厚度。建造全程零 AI 成本 —— 因为执行这件事根本不需要 AI 参与。底下还站着一个遵循真实物理的世界：气温、气压、水汽、风场，会自己下雨下雪、积水融雪，草跟着风一片片伏下去，那条大肥鱼会走动、会做梦、在日记本上写字。",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "index.js",
    "exports": {
        ".": "./index.js",
        "./client": "./client/index.js",
        "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
        "./icon": "./icon.svg",
        "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "files": [
        "index.js",
        "client/",
        "static/",
        "voxel/",
        "cordis.patch.yml",
        "locale/*.json",
        "docs",
        "assets/",
        "LICENSES/",
        "screenshots.json",
        "icon.svg",
        "README.md",
        "CREDITS.md",
        "LICENSE"
    ],
    "dsh": {
        "bundle": {
            "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
        },
        "client": {
            "platform": "web",
            "immediately": true,
            "inject": [
                "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme"
            ]
        }
    },
    "keywords": [
        "deepseek",
        "harness",
        "dsh",
        "dsh-plugin",
        "ai-native",
        "sandbox",
        "voxel",
        "voxel-art",
        "building",
        "world-canvas",
        "image-to-voxel",
        "weather",
        "simulation"
    ],
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "git+https://github.com/deepnoseedown/dsh-weather-sandbox.git"
    },
    "engines": {
        "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.1"
    },
    "peerDependencies": {
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme": ">=0.2.0-rc.1"
    },
    "peerDependenciesMeta": {
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme": {
            "optional": false
        }
    },
    "license": "MIT",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/deepnoseedown/dsh-weather-sandbox#readme"
}